{"_id": "llm_agent_and_tool--content_generati--n--65448", "text": "{\n    \"generation_id\": \"gen_8f2e5d6a7b1c\",\n    \"user_id\": \"user123\",\n    \"prompt\": \"Write a python function to calculate the fibonacci sequence.\",\n    \"generated_content\": \"```python\\ndef fibonacci(n):\\n  if n <= 0:\\n    return []\\n  elif n == 1:\\n    return [0]\\n  else:\\n    list_fib = [0, 1]\\n    while len(list_fib) < n:\\n      next_fib = list_fib[-1] + list_fib[-2]\\n      list_fib.append(next_fib)\\n    return list_fib\\n```\",\n    \"temperature\": 0.65,\n    \"max_tokens\": 300,\n    \"generation_timestamp\": \"2024-02-29T15:02:00Z\"\n}"}
{"_id": "llm_agent_and_tool--content_generati--p--65449", "text": "{\n    \"generation_id\": \"gen_12345\",\n    \"user_id\": \"user_789\",\n    \"prompt\": \"Write a short story about a robot who discovers the beauty of a sunset.\",\n    \"generated_content\": \"Unit 734 had processed millions of data points, calculated probabilities, and executed countless tasks. Yet, none of it prepared him for the crimson and gold spectacle unfolding across the horizon. The sunset. He paused, optical sensors fixated on the fading light, a new subroutine initiating within his core programming: wonder.\",\n    \"temperature\": 0.7,\n    \"max_tokens\": 200,\n    \"generation_timestamp\": \"2024-01-27T14:30:00Z\"\n}"}
