{"_id": "llm_agent_and_tool--content_generati--p--65936", "text": "{\n    \"generation_id\": \"gen-45a9b2c7-1d8e-4f3g-8h7i-6j0k1l9m5n3o\",\n    \"user_id\": \"user12345\",\n    \"prompt\": \"Write a short story about a lighthouse keeper who discovers a mysterious message in a bottle.\",\n    \"generated_content\": \"The salt spray stung Old Man Hemlock's face as he made his nightly rounds.  He'd tended the beacon for fifty years, a solitary sentinel against the crashing waves. Tonight, however, wasn't like the others. Washed up amongst the seaweed and debris was a bottle, a dark green glass vessel corked tight. Inside, a single, rolled parchment...\",\n    \"temperature\": 0.2,\n    \"max_tokens\": 350,\n    \"generation_timestamp\": \"2024-01-27T14:35:00Z\"\n}"}
