{"_id": "llm_agent_and_tool--content_generati--p--67711", "text": "{\n    \"generation_id\": \"gen-4567\",\n    \"user_id\": \"user123\",\n    \"prompt\": \"Write a Python function to perform a binary search on a sorted list.\",\n    \"generated_content\": \"```python\\ndef binary_search(arr, target):\\n  left = 0\\n  right = len(arr) - 1\\n\\n  while left <= right:\\n    mid = (left + right) // 2\\n\\n    if arr[mid] == target:\\n      return mid\\n    elif arr[mid] < target:\\n      left = mid + 1\\n    else:\\n      right = mid - 1\\n\\n  return -1\\n```\\nThis function efficiently searches for a target value within a sorted array using the binary search algorithm.\",\n    \"temperature\": 0.8,\n    \"max_tokens\": 200,\n    \"generation_timestamp\": \"2024-01-27T10:30:00Z\"\n}"}
