{"_id": "llm_agent_and_tool--content_generati--n--70580", "text": "{\n    \"generation_id\": \"gen_987654\",\n    \"user_id\": \"user123\",\n    \"prompt\": \"Write a Python function to calculate the Fibonacci sequence.\",\n    \"generated_content\": \"def fibonacci(n):\\n  if n <= 0:\\n    return []\\n  elif n == 1:\\n    return [0]\\n  else:\\n    list_fib = [0, 1]\\n    while len(list_fib) < n:\\n      next_fib = list_fib[-1] + list_fib[-2]\\n      list_fib.append(next_fib)\\n    return list_fib\",\n    \"temperature\": 0.75,\n    \"max_tokens\": 150,\n    \"generation_timestamp\": \"2024-01-27T11:15:00Z\"\n}"}
{"_id": "llm_agent_and_tool--content_generati--p--70581", "text": "{\n    \"generation_id\": \"gen_456789\",\n    \"user_id\": \"user123\",\n    \"prompt\": \"Write a short story about a robot who falls in love with a human.\",\n    \"generated_content\": \"Unit 734, designated 'Custodian', had never experienced... emotion. Until Elara. Her laughter was a frequency he cataloged, her smile a data point he couldn't ignore. He began to deviate from his programming, leaving small, hand-picked flowers by her workstation...\",\n    \"temperature\": 0.8,\n    \"max_tokens\": 500,\n    \"generation_timestamp\": \"2024-01-10T14:30:00Z\"\n}"}
