{"_id": "llm_agent_and_tool--content_generati--p--71535", "text": "{\n    \"generation_id\": \"gen-45678\",\n    \"user_id\": \"user123\",\n    \"prompt\": \"Write a short story about a cat who discovers a hidden portal in the attic.\",\n    \"generated_content\": \"Whiskers twitched, and a dust bunny floated past Mittens’ nose. The attic smelled of forgotten things and summer afternoons. Today, however, something was *different*. Behind a stack of old quilts, a shimmer… a doorway to somewhere else. It smelled of fish and stardust…\",\n    \"temperature\": 0.8,\n    \"max_tokens\": 250,\n    \"generation_timestamp\": \"2024-01-26T14:30:00Z\"\n}"}
