{"_id": "llm_agent_and_tool--content_generati--p--71855", "text": "{\n    \"generation_id\": \"gen_45678\",\n    \"user_id\": \"user123\",\n    \"prompt\": \"Write a short story about a lighthouse keeper who discovers a mysterious message in a bottle.\",\n    \"generated_content\": \"Old Man Hemlock had seen countless storms lash against the granite of his lighthouse. But nothing prepared him for the message he found wedged in the rocks below. The bottle, green and sea-worn, contained a single sheet of parchment covered in elegant, looping script. It spoke of a hidden cove, a lost treasure, and a sailor’s regret. Hemlock, a man of quiet routine, felt a stirring he hadn't known he possessed. He decided, against his better judgement, to seek out the cove…\",\n    \"temperature\": 0.8,\n    \"max_tokens\": 280,\n    \"generation_timestamp\": \"2024-02-29T10:30:00Z\"\n}"}
